From b9a8a03077714b1a463835a05dc1dfa5457a7767 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: J P <jpwatters@mac.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 31/42] Project PDF for v1.23.1-NAS

The series now applies to upstream v1.23.1 (ported 2026-10-31): DIRTY_RELAY
is 152 (upstream took 151 for the alternate JS8 submode); the Radio source
drawer section stays id 55; upstream's new tcpip-stack guard
(wifi_tcpip_stack_up) is also set by the Ethernet task. The PDF names v1.23.1
as the base, with diffs against it, and ends with the appendix "Initial
Setup of the QMX/QMX+ for use with the Tab5-Panadapter", the same text as the
README's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W7MAsxUnuCnfwkHxdqp61S
